      "title": "Note: Model links",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Qwen-Image 2.1 Turbo - BFS Face Swap (supporters version)\n\n**BFS - Best Face Swap** by **Alissonerdx** on the official **Qwen-Image 2.1 Turbo**, plus extra detail tricks: an automatic face close-up of your head reference (image 3), a detail prompt, a realism LoRA and a higher reference resolution.\n\n### LoRAs\n- [bfs_head_v1.1_qwen_2.1.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Alissonerdx/BFS-Best-Face-Swap/tree/main) -> `models/loras/` (strength 1.0)\n- [realism-qwen-image-2.1-edit-v2.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/houseofboern/realism-qwen-image-2.1-edit-v2/tree/main) by houseofboern -> `models/loras/realism/` (strength **0.4**; lower it if skin gets too rough, raise it for more texture on close and mid shots only)\n\n### Settings\n- KSampler: **8 steps, CFG 1, sampler lcm, scheduler bong_tangent** (RES4LYF node pack).\n- Text encoder resolution **1536** (the size your reference images are fed in at).\n- Image 1 = body, image 2 = head reference, image 3 = automatic close-up (FaceSegment at process_res 768 -> crop).\n\n### Tips\n- Sharp, front-facing head reference; a body shot with the face clearly visible (waist-up or closer).\n- Full-body shots from far away: switch the realism LoRA off, it can make the model copy the reference photo.\n- If a big smile on the body gets softened, try another seed.\n\n### Models\n- [qwen_image_2.1_turbo_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/tree/main/diffusion_models) -> `models/diffusion_models/` (default)\n- [qwen_image_2.1_turbo_Q5_K_M.gguf](https://huggingface.co/Abiray/Qwen-Image-2.1-Turbo-GGUF/tree/main) -> `models/unet/` (low VRAM: GGUF group)\n- [qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/tree/main/text_encoders) -> `models/text_encoders/`\n- [qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/tree/main/vae) -> `models/vae/`\n\nCustom nodes: ComfyUI-RMBG (FaceSegment, downloads its face model on first use), ComfyUI-Inpaint-CropAndStitch, rgthree-comfy, KJNodes, RES4LYF, ComfyUI-GGUF.\nUse responsibly: only swap faces of people who gave consent, never public figures."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Qwen-Image 2.1 Turbo - BFS Face Swap (supporters version)\n\n**BFS - Best Face Swap** by **Alissonerdx** on the official **Qwen-Image 2.1 Turbo**, plus extra detail tricks: an automatic face close-up of your head reference (image 3), a detail prompt, a realism LoRA and a higher reference resolution.\n\n### LoRAs\n- [bfs_head_v1.1_qwen_2.1.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Alissonerdx/BFS-Best-Face-Swap/tree/main) -> `models/loras/` (strength 1.0)\n- [realism-qwen-image-2.1-edit-v2.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/houseofboern/realism-qwen-image-2.1-edit-v2/tree/main) by houseofboern -> `models/loras/realism/` (strength **0.4**; lower it if skin gets too rough, raise it for more texture on close and mid shots only)\n\n### Settings\n- KSampler: **8 steps, CFG 1, sampler lcm, scheduler bong_tangent** (RES4LYF node pack).\n- Text encoder resolution **1536** (the size your reference images are fed in at).\n- Image 1 = body, image 2 = head reference, image 3 = automatic close-up (FaceSegment at process_res 768 -> crop).\n\n### Tips\n- Sharp, front-facing head reference; a body shot with the face clearly visible (waist-up or closer).\n- Full-body shots from far away: switch the realism LoRA off, it can make the model copy the reference photo.\n- If a big smile on the body gets softened, try another seed.\n\n### Models\n- [qwen_image_2.1_turbo_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/tree/main/diffusion_models) -> `models/diffusion_models/` (default)\n- [qwen_image_2.1_turbo_Q5_K_M.gguf](https://huggingface.co/Abiray/Qwen-Image-2.1-Turbo-GGUF/tree/main) -> `models/unet/` (low VRAM: GGUF group)\n- [qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/tree/main/text_encoders) -> `models/text_encoders/`\n- [qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/tree/main/vae) -> `models/vae/`\n\nCustom nodes: ComfyUI-RMBG (FaceSegment, downloads its face model on first use), ComfyUI-Inpaint-CropAndStitch, rgthree-comfy, KJNodes, RES4LYF, ComfyUI-GGUF.\nUse responsibly: only swap faces of people who gave consent, never public figures."
