      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Note: BFS face swap (TheLocalLab)",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## BFS face swap\n- image 1 = BODY photo, image 2 = HEAD reference (order matters).\n- A close-up of the head reference is cut automatically (RMBG Face Segment) and used as image 3 for skin, freckles and eye detail.\n- Settings: Turbo, BFS V1.1 + realism LoRA 0.4, 8 steps, CFG 1, lcm + bong_tangent, encoder resolution 1536.\n- Best results: a sharp, front-facing head reference.\n- Use responsibly: only swap faces of people who gave consent, never public figures.\n\nCustom nodes: ComfyUI-RMBG, ComfyUI-Inpaint-CropAndStitch, rgthree-comfy, KJNodes, RES4LYF, ComfyUI-GGUF (low VRAM)."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## BFS face swap\n- image 1 = BODY photo, image 2 = HEAD reference (order matters).\n- A close-up of the head reference is cut automatically (RMBG Face Segment) and used as image 3 for skin, freckles and eye detail.\n- Settings: Turbo, BFS V1.1 + realism LoRA 0.4, 8 steps, CFG 1, lcm + bong_tangent, encoder resolution 1536.\n- Best results: a sharp, front-facing head reference.\n- Use responsibly: only swap faces of people who gave consent, never public figures.\n\nCustom nodes: ComfyUI-RMBG, ComfyUI-Inpaint-CropAndStitch, rgthree-comfy, KJNodes, RES4LYF, ComfyUI-GGUF (low VRAM)."
